<title>USA: HFS Inc to take Q2 merger-related charge.</title>
<headline>HFS Inc to take Q2 merger-related charge.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>HFS Inc said on Tuesday it will take a second quarter pre-tax charge of about $265 million in connection with its pending merger with PHH Corp.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the charge to result in annual pre-tax cost savings of about $100 million, with the full benefit of the cost reductions beginning in 1998.</p>
<p>It also said it will report first quarter results with and without PHH, and that it expects results on each basis to exceed analysts' expectations.  </p>
<p>Analysts on average are expecting first quarter earnings per share of $0.42, according to First Call.</p>
</text>
